# Rust build artifacts
/target/
/proving/target/
/scripts/readdit-differential/target/

# Circuit artifacts that proving/scripts/fetch-artifacts.sh downloads.
/proving/artifacts/
**/*.rs.bk

# UniFFI bindings ARE committed. The Kotlin SDK vendors the generated .kt as
# source (the same way it vendors zk-cred-*), so it has to be reviewable here
# and diffable when the FFI surface changes. `make check-bindings` compares the
# working tree against a fresh generation — which only means anything if the
# files are tracked.

